**Requirements:**
- Consolidate sales from 500 retail stores
- Data arrives from 3 different POS systems
- Daily load with real-time dashboard
- Historical data for trend analysis

**Solution Architecture:**

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ 500 Retail Stores                       │
│ ├─ System A: 200 stores (XML files)     │
│ ├─ System B: 200 stores (REST API)      │
│ └─ System C: 100 stores (CSV files)     │
└────────────┬────────────────────────────┘
             │
     ┌───────▼────────┐
     │ EXTRACT Layer  │
     │ (Parallel)     │
     └───────┬────────┘
             │
     ┌───────▼──────────────────┐
